ter; color: #A78BFA;\">100%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #34D399; font-weight: 800;\">30:51<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #E2E8F0;\">01:01:39<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #C4B5FD;\">01:00:13<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Loures Odivelas 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona Loures Odivelas 2026<\/strong> (4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, integrando as comemora\u00e7\u00f5es da Semana Europeia do Desporto. Sob o lema \u00abJuntos pelo Desporto\u00bb, o evento \u00e9 organizado em estreita parceria pelos <strong>Munic\u00edpios de Loures e Odivelas<\/strong> com apoio t\u00e9cnico da <strong>We Run<\/strong>, revivendo a emblem\u00e1tica liga\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica entre as duas cidades vizinhas, com partida e meta centralizadas no apraz\u00edvel <strong>Parque Ad\u00e3o Barata<\/strong>, em <strong>Loures<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa atl\u00e9tico oferece dist\u00e2ncias para todos os n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: a prova rainha da <strong>Meia Maratona (21 km)<\/strong> com tempo limite de 2h30, a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong>, a acess\u00edvel <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> e a entusiasta <strong>Corrida Kids<\/strong> na v\u00e9spera. Os atletas beneficiam de abastecimentos de \u00e1gua em copos reciclados ao longo do percurso, blocos de partida organizados por ritmos (desde sub 4:00 min\/km a 6:00 min\/km), cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com acompanhamento de classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e entrega de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha de finalista na meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-wid